LSTM - (Long Short Term Memory)
    Artificail neural network designed to process data that comes in a sequence

    RNN - Recurrent Neural network
    RNN + internal state => LSTM

    State  ---- > LSTM cell
                    |----->  forget gate , input gate , output gate

            forget gate - says what sort  of state information stored in this internal state
            input gate  - new information add or update to the working storage state information
            output gate -  which part of the information is to the output

            gate value --> 0 or 1

            gate value = 0 --> gate is closed
            gate value = 1 --> gate is open

going on...
